Deep View for DSH

This package includes adapted source from deep-view 0.1.0:
https://github.com/Fei2411/deep-view

Source files and migration boundaries:
- src/core/formula.js: deep-view/src/core/formula.js (safe expression interpreter).
- src/core/views.js: deep-view/src/core/views.js (validation, evaluation and answers; html removed).
- src/ui.tsx: deep-view/src/react/ui.js (labels and simple controls).
- src/chart.tsx: deep-view/src/react/chart.js (SVG chart calculations and interaction).
- src/widget.tsx: deep-view/src/react/card.js (view composition and local input).

The upstream package is licensed under Apache License 2.0. See LICENSE for the
complete license text supplied with the upstream source. No upstream NOTICE file
was present in the inspected deep-view 0.1.0 package.

Changes for this package include TypeScript React migration, dvui-* scoped class
names, direct official --dsw-* theme token references, locale and Slot/RPC
integration, removal of the html component and PNG export, and a non-persistent
validated answer channel. Original icons in icon.svg are new artwork for this
package, not upstream artwork.

The surrounding DSH integration code is provided under Apache License 2.0.
